		(property "Description" "Si5351A 8kHz-160MHz I2C Clock Generator\n\n• VDD: 2.5V or 3.3V\n• Input Range: 25MHz or 27MHz XTAL\n• User selectable internal input load capacitors: 6, 8 or 10 pF\n• Output Impedance: 85 Ohm\n• Output Load Capacitance: 5-15pF\n• Operating Temperature: -40°C - 85°C\n• Operating Current (3 outputs): 35mA\n• Output buffer voltage (VDDO): 1.8, 2.5 or 3.3V\n\nNote: If VDDO is not used it should be connected to VDD. Unused clock out pins should be left floating."
